        },
        {
          "text": "Farawo ahamagaza Mose aramubwira ati “Nimugende mukorere Uwiteka, ariko imikumbi yanyu n'amashyo yanyu abe ari byo bisigara, abana banyu bato mubajyane.”",
          "type": "text",
